 "notes": "MS-24 (1979): plates 1-4 are geologic maps of the Lowndesville, Latimer, Abbeville West and Abbeville East quadrangles on topographic bases; plate 5 cross sections A-A' to E-E' (500 ft to -1000 ft, sea level datum); plate 6 tectonic map. Unit list taken from the plate 5 explanation (the fullest); units not in stratigraphic order, no ages. Strike/dip numbers have no printed coordinates. No drill holes. The accompanying text is not in this packet. SUBSURFACE: sections are interpretive (no holes); unit labels along sections not itemized.",
